<title>USA: Albertson's Nov same-store sales up 1.7 pct.</title>
<headline>Albertson's Nov same-store sales up 1.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BOISE, Idaho 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Albertson's Inc said on Monday its comparable sales for the five-week period ended Dec 5 increased 1.7 percent over the same five-week period last year while total sales increased 9.6 percent.</p>
<p>Albertson's, based in Boise, is a retail food and drug chain store.</p>
